1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:01,545
(Leonard:)Just like you.

2
00:00:02,778 --> 00:00:04,178
(Penny:)I'm just saying,
you pretend you don't,

3
00:00:04,179 --> 00:00:05,909
(Penny:)but you have feelings
just like everybody else.

4
00:00:05,914 --> 00:00:08,384
(Sheldon:)Not true. No, look at me.

5
00:00:08,383 --> 00:00:10,653
(Sheldon:)I had an engagement
ring to give a girl,

6
00:00:10,652 --> 00:00:12,222
(Sheldon:)and instead,
she rejected me.

7
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,090
(Sheldon:)And am I emotional
about that? No.

8
00:00:14,089 --> 00:00:16,259
(Sheldon:)No, I am sitting here
on a couch,

9
00:00:16,258 --> 00:00:18,058
(Sheldon:)talking about my
favorite TV character

10
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,390
(Sheldon:)like nothing happened.

11
00:00:19,394 --> 00:00:21,964
'Cause I am just like him:
all logical, all the time.

12
00:00:21,963 --> 00:00:23,033
(Penny:)Sweetie, you're yelling.

13
00:00:23,031 --> 00:00:24,631
(Sheldon:)Because when I speak
at a regular volume,

14
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:25,833
(Sheldon:)no one seems to believe me

15
00:00:25,834 --> 00:00:27,764
(Sheldon:)that I've put
this Amy nonsense behind me!

16
00:00:30,706 --> 00:00:31,906
(door slams)

17
00:00:33,208 --> 00:00:37,278
(Wil:)This documentary
is gonna be awesome.

18
00:00:39,815 --> 00:00:42,515
(Mr Rostenkowski:)You gonna be okay down here?
Yeah. Yeah,

19
00:00:42,517 --> 00:00:43,987
(Howard:)I feel like
an archaeologist.

20
00:00:43,985 --> 00:00:47,455
Indiana Jones and
the Single-Family Dwelling.

21
00:00:48,323 --> 00:00:50,093
Hey. Look!

22
00:00:50,092 --> 00:00:51,992
(Howard:)Found a seashell.

23
00:00:51,993 --> 00:00:55,193
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Yeah, that's a rat skull.
(shrieks)

24
00:00:55,197 --> 00:00:57,097
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Relax.

25
00:00:57,099 --> 00:01:00,669
(Mr Rostenkowski:)There's enough droppings down
here without you making more.

